<% content_for :title, "Community guidelines" %>

<div class="content-grid">
  <div class="row mt-4 mt-md-5">
    <article class="col-12 col-md-8 col-offset-md-2">
      <hgroup>
        <h1>Community guidelines</h1>
        <p>Updated on <time datetime="2026-11-10">November 10, 2026</time></p>
      </hgroup>

      <section class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="fs-3 mb-2">Share useful recipes</h2>
        <p>Write clear quantities and preparation steps. Call out known allergens and unusual techniques where relevant. Do not present a drink as a treatment, a health benefit or a guarantee of safe alcohol consumption.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="fs-3 mb-2">Respect creators</h2>
        <p>Upload photos and text only when you have the rights to share them. Add source credits when adapting a recipe. Do not impersonate creators or claim someone else’s work as your own.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="fs-3 mb-2">Respect people and their privacy</h2>
        <p>Do not publish harassment, hate, threats, spam, or other people’s personal information without permission. Keep private account details out of public recipes, collections and profile images.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="fs-3 mb-2">Share responsibly</h2>
        <p>Do not encourage underage drinking, dangerous drinking challenges or drinking before driving. Alcohol-free recipes are welcome.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="fs-3 mb-2">Raise a concern</h2>
        <%= render "contact", purpose: "content concerns or copyright reports" %>
        <p>A report should identify the recipe or profile, describe the concern and include any relevant source or ownership details. Never include passwords or other sensitive account credentials.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
